# 1. Calibration
Calibration with the default settings. Running the file as a script produces the same log and archives it in `calibration_results/` automatically.

julia --project=. -t 3
result_calib = calibrate_history_independent_tax(calib = CalibrationParams(asset_moment = :median))

=== Calibration targets ===
median assets / mean labor income        = 0.04300000
true borrowing limit / mean labor income = 0.18000000
share negative liquid assets             = 0.26000000

